   "solution": "def func_a(arr):  # 걸린 시간 계산\n    ret = []\n    for a in arr:\n        start_time = func_b(a[0])\n        end_time = func_b(a[1])\n        ret.append(end_time - start_time)\n    return ret\n\ndef func_b(s):  # 초 단위 환산\n    hour = int(s[0]) * 10 + int(s[1])\n    minute = int(s[3]) * 10 + int(s[4])\n    second = int(s[6]) * 10 + int(s[7])\n    return hour * 3600 + minute * 60 + second\n\ndef func_c(arr):\n    min_num = min(arr)\n    for i, a in enumerate(arr):\n        if min_num == a:\n            return i + 1\n\ndef solution(times):\n    records = func_a(times)\n    answer = func_c(records)\n    return answer",
